# hello-world v1.0.0

## Purpose
Demonstrate phext-native seed lifecycle with coordinate-addressed scrolls.

## Why These Scrolls Exist

- All scrolls live in ONE phext file
- Each scroll addressable by coordinate
- Plain text serialization
- Lineage emerges from coordinate topology

